  m_Name: Moonpetal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Moonpetal
  tab: 2
  picture: {fileID: -8626398517072026418, guid: 8ec048f4c4455354fa44d6353040ac55, type: 3}
  loreText: "Moonpetals open only under moonlight and close the moment dawn touches
    them. In the dark they give off a soft silver glow, and lost travellers have
    followed them out of forests they thought they\u2019d never leave.\n\nThe church\u2019s
    old records mention Moonpetal water being used to \u201Ccalm restless spirits\u201D,
    and the flower is still left at graves in the village. Alchemists value it above
    most herbs: it binds other ingredients together, so a potion\u2019s strength
    doesn\u2019t fade.\n\nGather them at night. A Moonpetal picked by daylight wilts
    to grey in your hand."
  startsUnlocked: 1
